  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\n\n# Meet Our Surgeons\n\n\nOur surgeons at Santa Monica Center for Oral Surgery & Dental Implants are highly experienced, specializing in oral and maxillofacial surgery.\n\n\n# Meet Our Surgeons\n\n\n\n## Dr. Howard H.\n\n\n\n## Park\n\n\n\n## Park\n\n\n\n## DDM, MD\n\n\nView Bio\n\n\n## Dr. Richard H.\n\n\n\n## Ting\n\n\n\n## Ting\n\n\n\n## DDS, MD\n\n\n\n## Dr. Gil B.\n\n\n\n## Ivry\n\n\n\n## Ivry\n\n\n\n## DDS, MD\n\n\n\n## Dr. Jeffrey M.\n\n\n\n## Tanner\n\n\n\n## Tanner\n\n\n\n## DDS, MD\n\n\n\n## Dr. Derek L.\n\n\n\n## Vajda\n\n\n\n## Vajda\n\n\n\n## DDS, MD.\n\n\n\n## Dr. Harry\n\n\n\n## Schwartz\n\n\n\n## Schwartz\n\n\n\n## DMD, MD, FACS\n\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
